Urakatsu is a refactored version of Koharu, an ML-powered manga translator written in Rust:
https://github.com/koharu-rs/koharu

Its pipeline, scene model and typesetting follow Koharu, and parts of this project are derived
from Koharu's source. Koharu is copyright (c) 2025-2026 Mayo Takanashi and Koharu contributors,
and is dual-licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License, Version 2.0, at your option.
Urakatsu uses Koharu under the MIT License, and the notice and license text below are included
as that license requires. The full texts of both licenses are at
https://github.com/koharu-rs/koharu/blob/main/LICENSE-MIT and
https://github.com/koharu-rs/koharu/blob/main/LICENSE-APACHE

The Koharu name and logo identify that project. Their use here credits where Urakatsu comes from
and does not imply endorsement by Koharu's authors.

